 "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572931_1559920857748486_3682558990057241325_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rdbv7RM3l5MQ7kNvwHtTylP&_nc_oc=AdrvzrbKOol1INexu9LtUylanayVgX-cdo7XZPxrqq3layiDxmBb75uktopOUkqtAp0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRjYja5bvdHLPnUAuT45CvVeZ_FL0rUp83P3h8uqgS7KQ&oe=6AFF158A"}, "display_name": "The Woozles", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Dive into the world of Mechanica, in an immersive augmented reality adventure where your living space transforms into a steampunk wonderland! \n\nGuide the Gizmoids, Professor Gearheart's creations, as they navigate challenges in your own home, now a mystical terrain. Augmented reality crafts your furniture into mountains, floors into lava pools, and windows into magical gateways. \n\nEach game mirrors your environment, ensuring ever-fresh gameplay. Battle the Malignites, craft ingenious devices, and lead the hero Gizmoid to victory. In Mechanica, magic meets machinery right in your living room. Ready to reshape reality? \n\nJoin the steampunk saga in this early access release! ", "short_description": "Dive into the world of Mechanica, an enchanted steampunk realm! Assist Prof. Gearheart and guide his mechanical marvels, the Gizmoids, through intricate home environments transformed into whimsical landscapes. Craft bridges, decipher puzzles, and fend off menacing fauna and transdimensional foes. With a stream of quirky challenges and a hero Gizmoid to lead the charge, your mission is to harvest the mystical Aetherium. Ready your gears; a steam-powered adventure awaits!"}]}, "developer_name": "Impossible Robert", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wetzold.com/woozles/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Robert Wetzold", "support_website_url": "https://wetzold.com/woozles/", "website_url": "https://wetzold.com/woozles/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NO